[statement]
The order of `a-real-name-before-a-virtual-one-virtual-first` holds in a request too:
asked for `v c`, apk decides `c` first, and its dependency installs
`p4`, which provides `v`.

[repository]
P:c
V:1.0-r0
D:p4

P:p4
V:1.0-r0
p:v
k:400

P:p5
V:1.0-r0
p:v
k:500

[request]
v
c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p4 1.0-r0
install c 1.0-r0
